OL,3,AMajor travel disruption and thousands
OL,4,Awithout power as Storm Austen hits UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreat Western Railway warns of
OL,7,Fdisruption due to fallen trees on
OL,8,Fseveral train lines in Devon and
OL,9,FCornwall, while Network Rail Scotland
OL,10,Fsays trains will be slowed down along
OL,11,Fparts of the West and East coast main
OL,12,Flines
OL,14,FOn Saturday, a separate storm, named
OL,15,FBoelo, is forecast to bring more strong
OL,16,Fwinds to Scotland, Northern Ireland and
OL,17,Fnorthern England
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
